🔗 PART 13: LINK-BASED ACCESS


---

Example:

https://apps.powerapps.com/play/appId=XXX&section=QA


---

What happens:

1. App opens


2. Reads section=QA


3. Auto selects QA


4. Loads data


5. Applies access control




---

✔ No need to manually select section


---

🎯 PART 14: HOW EVERYTHING CONNECTS


---

Flow:

1. App opens


2. Reads URL


3. Loads Section


4. Loads Suppliers + Questions


5. Builds matrix


6. Checks access


7. Enables/disables UI


8. User selects score


9. Data saved to SharePoint




